Author: Goheeca

The build can take a while with all those refined curve definitions
on my machine it's over 2 min.

Cabal:

Getting started:
Download & install Haskell Platform:
https://www.haskell.org/platform/

Installation:
cabal install -j -O2

Run:
cabal run

Documentation:
cabal haddock --haddock-executables

Stack:

Getting started:
Download & Install Stack:
https://haskellstack.org/

Build:
stack build

Run:
stack exec ReifiableElliptic
